{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 157006, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 104937, "uid": 81618, "type": 4, "title": "DC韩语速成-3、收音", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1653445373, "updated_at": 1653445373, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1653453252, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "韩语中一共有27个收音，其中，16个是单收音，11个是双收音。虽然数量很多，但其实只有7个发音。单收音：ㄱ、ㄷ、ㄴ、ㄹ、ㅂ、ㅁ、ㅇ、ㅋ、ㅌ、ㅅ、ㅈ、ㅊ、ㅍ、ㅎ、ㄲ、ㅆ。双收音：ㄳ、ㄺ、ㄵ、ㄶ、ㄾ、ㄼ、", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 0, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 3863, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 157006, "content": "<span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br><div>韩语中一共有27个收音，其中，16个是单收音，11个是双收音。虽然数量很多，但其实只有7个发音。</div><div>单收音：ㄱ<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄷ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄴ、ㄹ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㅂ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㅁ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㅇ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㅋ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㅌ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㅅ、ㅈ、ㅊ、ㅍ、ㅎ、ㄲ、ㅆ。</span></div><div>双收音：ㄳ<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄺ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄵ、ㄶ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄾ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄼ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄽ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㅀ、ㅄ、ㄿ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、ㄻ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">。</span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">字的结构</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">在</span>韩语字中，没有收音时：左右结构的字，左边是子音，右边是母音；上下<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">结构的字，上边是子音，下边是母音；包围结构的字，左上是子音，剩下是母音。有收音时，收音写在正下方。</span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">收音的7个发音</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㄱ</span>：舌根抬起接触软腭，使气流完全被阻挡。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㄷ</span>：舌尖接触上齿龈，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">使气流完全被阻挡。</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㄴ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">舌尖接触上齿龈，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">使气流完全被阻挡，然后用鼻腔发音。像英语中以“n”结尾单词的尾音。</span></span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\"></span>ㄹ</span></span>：</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">舌尖接触上齿龈，使气流从舌头两边通过。有一点<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">像英语<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">中</span>以“l”结尾单词的尾音。</span></span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅂ</span>：双唇闭起来，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">使气流完全被阻挡。</span></span><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅁ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">双唇闭起来，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">使气流完全被阻挡，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">然后用<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">鼻腔</span>发音。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">像英语<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">中</span>以“m”结尾单词的尾音。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅇ</span>：软腭放下接触舌根，然后用<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">鼻腔</span>发音。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">像汉语拼音中的后鼻音“ng”。</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">其他收音</p></div></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">ㅋ、</span>ㄲ、ㄳ、ㄺ</span>：同“ㄱ”，特征：都有“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄱ</span>”。</span></span></span></span><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;\">ㅌ、ㅅ、ㅈ、ㅊ<span style=\"\">、</span><span style=\"\">ㅆ</span><span style=\"\">、</span><span style=\"\">ㅎ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">：同“</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">ㄷ”。</span><br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㄵ、ㄶ</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">：同“</span>ㄴ”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，特征：都有“</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄴ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">”。</span><br></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">ㄾ、</span>ㄼ、ㄽ、ㅀ</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">：同“</span>ㄹ”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㅍ、ㅄ、ㄿ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span>：同“<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅂ”。</span><br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㄻ</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">：同“</span>ㅁ”。<br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span></div></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div><br></div><div>（<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">至此，韩语中所有的收音就都学完啦，撒花 x 3</span>）</div></span></span></span><div></div></span><div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"